    "text": "Iwrn us was geswuteled \u00feurh witegie and erendrache \u00feat God wolde man becume al for ure sache.\nDo\u00f0 god for his lufe, cume\u00f0 bli\u00f0eliche to chirche, ouer seruise to herenne swa wile God \u00feat ge moten.\nGod almihti \u00fee his fader and sune and holi gost, on \u00fereo wise to dai his michele mihte swetelede.\n\u00deat giue he eu chnawe his \u00fereomnesse, and mihtte and streng\u00fee wel to donne, swa giue Crist us alle,\nUre Drihte nehlechende his passiun, isohte \u00fereo stedes \u00feider ward, and \u00feat was \u00fee feor\u00f0e.\n\u00deat he lede ey on domes d\u00e6i into heuenriche \u00fee o schal ileste.\nAbacuc \u00fee prophet witegede of \u00fee hechnesse of \u00feisse deige michel er he icume were.\nAc al hit was to dai iturnd to blisse \u00feurh his upstigunge.\nFor \u00feider he haue\u00f0 ila\u00f0ed us ealle to astige, swa wille God \u00feat we mote.\n\u00d0e holi witege David \u00fee was king of Ierusalem meni hundred wintre er \u00fean ure Drihte mon bicome.\nCrist gife us mihte and stren\u00f0e \u00fees fower kinne teres to schedenne and \u00feer mide heuenriche bigeten.\nMuchel we owgie to wur\u00f0ienne \u00feisne dei \u00feat is sunne icliped, for hit is Godes ogie dei.\n\u00deider mote we cume \u00fear is wane of alle ifel and fille of iche gode.\nWo is \u00fee men \u00fee wo is and me him mot bihat and mai and wile hit him ileste.\nAnd \u00feonne mei he God filie and efter him iwende to heouenriche and swa wile almihti God \u00feat we\n\u00dee heuenliche cwen ure lefuedi Seinte Marie heue\u00f0 fif feste inne twelf mone\u00f0.\n\u00deat ge mote swa him hersume inne \u00feisse liue \u00feat ge habbe on domes dei \u00feat lif \u00feat o o seal ileste.\nBifore alle \u00feing, \u00fereo \u00feing beo\u00f0 efric man helwuur\u00fee, and \u00e6rest bihoue\u00f0 tehabbe.\nAnd wi\u00f0holde \u00feat we mote eche riche habbe, o o buten ende.\nUre drihte \u00fee gef bo\u00f0e \u00fee olde lage and \u00fee neue.\nAnd cume to \u00feere michele blisse \u00fee he on wune\u00f0.\n\u00d0eos word \u00fee ic nu her for\u00f0 teh, spec ure Drihte \u00e6t sume time.\nMid \u00feis wepne was David iscryd \u00feo\u00feo he Goliam his unwine ofercom swa wile God \u00feat we ure\nLucas \u00fee Godspellere \u00fee trehnede \u00fee holie Godspel of \u00feisse dei.\nMarie haue\u00f0 icore \u00fee wele \u00fee hyre nefre ne truche\u00f0.\nUre drihten spech on one stede on \u00fean holie Godspelle.\nGod almihti giue eow his lichame swa to dai underfo, \u00feat ge \u00feer \u00feurh iwinne ower sawle eche lif.",
